{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/tool/test-bin.sh","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:04:07.305067Z","id":"6e05f24a5f6ccf69b2a41d92e1c3c94b8aab3d4527e7b8eaa18ecfc4349effbf","body":{"detail":"When `cargo build` fails and target/clax-bin/debug holds no kept binary, `ls` exits 1, `set -o pipefail` makes the pipeline fail, and `set -e` ends the script at this assignment, so the `test-bin: cargo build failed and no kept clax exists` message on line 15 is never printed. The exit code is still 1. Reproduced with `bash -c 'set -euo pipefail; newest=\"$(ls -t nothere/*/clax 2>/dev/null | awk \"NR == 1\")\"; echo reached'`, which exits 1 without printing.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":13},"end":{"line":13},"content_hash":"b7582f533743fd6c577d000b1736a347a2418f6e37c74d990a79ab0a01289ce6"},"suggested_fix":"`newest=\"$(ls -t target/clax-bin/debug/*/clax 2>/dev/null | awk 'NR == 1' || true)\"`.","summary":"With no kept clax, test-bin.sh exits 1 silently: pipefail plus set -e end it at this assignment before its error message","tags":["review","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/tool/test-bin.sh","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:07:37.346591Z","id":"c7fdf650550620c4a56f1ec5807d84bf1a42bbf8125ac9516134af35a2f05675","body":{"detail":"Copied to a scratch repository with a `cargo` shim that exits 101: with no kept clax it prints `test-bin: cargo build failed and no kept clax exists under target/clax-bin/debug` and exits 1; with one kept clax it prints the warning naming it and its absolute path, exit 0.","kind":"resolve","ref":"git:33d400d1","summary":"The ls pipeline ends in `|| true`, so an empty store reaches the error message","supersedes":"6e05f24a5f6ccf69b2a41d92e1c3c94b8aab3d4527e7b8eaa18ecfc4349effbf","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
